---
import Container from "../shared/Container.astro";
import Paragraph from "../shared/Paragraph.astro";
import BtnLinkStart from "../shared/BtnLinkStart.astro";
import TypewriterText from "@astroanimate/core/TypewriterText";
---

<section class="relative pt-6 lg:pt-12">
  <Container className={"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-10 lg:gap-12"}>
    <div class="absolute w-full lg:w-1/2 inset-y-0 lg:right-0">
      <span
        class="absolute -left-6 md:left-[-48] top-24 lg:top-24 w-90 h-90 rotate-0 blur-xs rounded-full bg-orange-50 opacity-60 lg:opacity-95 lg:block hidden"
        ><img src="./images/teamss.png" alt="teams logo" /></span
      >
      <span
        class="absolute right-4 bottom-12 w-24 h-24 rounded-3xl bg-blue-500 blur-xl opacity-80"
      ></span>
    </div>

    <div
      class="relative flex flex-col text-left lg:py-7 xl:py-8
        items-start lg:max-w-none max-w-3xl mx-auto lg:mx-0 lg:flex-1 lg:w-1/2"
    >
      <span class="bg-pink-700 text-xs p-0.5 text-white rounded font-semibold"
        >Cohort 1.0</span
      >
      <h1
        class="text-[40px]/tight md:text-5xl/tight tracking-tight xl:text-[3.4rem]/tight font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 dark:from-pink-600 via-blue-800 to-black dark:to-white bg-clip-text text-transparent"
      >
        M365 Bootcamp: <br />

        <span> 6 Weeks Admin Mastery of </span>
        <span class="inline-block
      min-w-[12ch]
      whitespace-nowrap">
          <TypewriterText
            texts={[
              "Exchange",
              "SharePoint",
              "Entra ID",
              "OneDrive",
              "Security",
              "Teams",
            ]}
            enhance
          />
        </span>
      </h1>

      <mark
        class="border-2 border-pink-700 bg-white p-0.5 rounded font-bold pr-1 pl-1 text-pink-700 text-xs md:text-sm"
        ><i class="fa fa-bullhorn font-bold text-pink-700"></i> 1<sup>st</sup> August
        - 16th September, 2026</mark
      >

      <Paragraph className="mt-5">
        In six weeks, you will progress from basic familiarity to confident
        administration of core Microsoft 365 services, including Exchange,
        Teams, SharePoint & OneDrive, Azure, Microsoft Defender and Entra ID.
        Each session is built around real-world administrative
        scenarios—equipping you not just to understand the platform, but to
        effectively manage users, secure data, optimize environments, and
        resolve everyday operational challenges.
      </Paragraph>
      <div
        class="mt-5 w-full flex flex-row max-w-full mx-auto lg:mx-0 space-x-4"
      >
        <div class="lg:min-w-max flex lg:items-center sm:w-max w-full">
          <BtnLinkStart
            text="Explore Learning"
            href="/weekone"
            className="flex justify-center w-full sm:w-max"
            variant="primary"
          />
        </div>
        <div
          class="lg:min-w-max flex lg:items-center sm:w-max w-full lg:pb-0 border-b border-box-bg lg:border-0 lg:px-0"
        >
          <button
            class="open-modal-btn bg-primary text-white text-sm py-3 px-2 w-full
            md:text-md
            md:px-6
            md:py-3
            rounded-full
            outline-none
            relative
            overflow-hidden
            duration-300
            ease-linear
            z-0
            after:absolute
            after:inset-x-0
            after:aspect-square
            after:scale-0
            after:opacity-70
            after:origin-center
            after:duration-300
            after:ease-linear
            after:rounded-full
            after:top-0
            after:left-0
            after:bg-[#172554]
            after:z-[-1]
            hover:text-white
            hover:after:opacity-100
            shadow-orange-500
            animate-soft-glow
            hover:after:scale-[2.5]"
          >
            <span class="relative z-10"> Register Now </span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-1 lg:w-1/2 lg:h-auto relative lg:max-w-none lg:mx-0 mx-auto max-w-3xl"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/blue.png"
        alt="Hero image"
        width="2350"
        height="2359"
        class="lg:absolute lg:w-full lg:h-full object-cover lg:max-h-none max-h-96"
      />
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
